      "facts": {
        "cve": "CVE-2026-88856",
        "vendor": "OrdaSoft.com",
        "product": "OrdaSoft Joomla Gallery free extension for Joomla",
        "title": null,
        "description": "Joomla Extension - OrdaSoft.com - Authenticated, Privileged Remote Code Execution in OrdaSoft Joomla Gallery extension for Joomla < 6.2.7 - The extensions updateOSGallery(), reached via task=update_osgallery, read a JSON request body and called the value of a method field as a live PHP function, passing the value of a package field as its single argument, with no allow-list or is_callable() check of any kind. Any function name compatible with a single argument was directly reachable, including system, exec, shell_exec, and passthru.",
